@startuml

hide footbox

participant Buyer
participant Seller

Buyer -> Seller : POST {{baseUrl}}/hub with {{callbackUrl}} details
Seller --> Buyer: 201 confirmation with an {{id}}

...

Buyer -> Seller : POST {{baseUrl}}/geographicAddressValidation\n(instantSyncValidation=false)
Seller -> Seller : validate Request

alt Seller can provide immediate response(<30 s)
  Buyer <-- Seller : 200 GeographicAddressValidation (state=ready, no id)
  ...

else Seller provides deferred response
  Buyer <-- Seller : 201 GeographicAddressValidation (state=acknowledged, id)

  group loop [until GeographicAddressValidation in final state]
      Seller -> Buyer: {{callbackUrl}}/listener/geographicAddressValidationStateChangeEvent ({{id}})
      Buyer --> Seller : 204 confirmation
      Buyer -> Seller : GET {{baseUrl}}/geographicAddressValidation/{{id}}
      return 200 GeographicAddressValidation (state, id)
  end


else validation or internal problem
  Seller --> Buyer : 4xx or 5xx error response
end 

...

Buyer -> Seller : DELETE {{baseUrl}}/hub/{{id}} 
Seller -->  Buyer : 204 confirmation

@enduml